24	//	newRoots == roots reported by TraceSources in the new snapshot
25	//
26	// and a dataset lands in rootSourceChanges if and only if those two sets
27	// differ. A change of the representative PATH alone (a branch moving onto
28	// another route to the same root, or a new shortcut to an already reachable
29	// root) must never be reported as a source change; when the last route to an
30	// old root disappears, every still-common dataset that loses it must be listed
